Fixed (\`418fd6d6e\`): the per-list manual-token Attio webhook path (\`handleAttioEvent\` in crmWebhook.ts) had no per-event try/catch — a throw from \`applyAttioPersonEvent\` aborted the loop and skipped the \`updateSyncTimestamp\` call entirely, leaving a failed delivery's \`lastPullSyncAt\`/\`lastSyncStatus\` silently stale with no indication anything went wrong. Now mirrors the identical per-event try/catch already used in the shared OAuth job's \`processAttioWebhookJob\`.

